# Getreidegasse house wall: pastel pink render p with E shade; stone corner
# pilasters m i (left) and n d (right) on exposed sides; one window per tile: d opening with T/b glass (1 px w glint),
# stucco hood and sill i. Exposed top = stone cornice i/m with an E shadow;
# exposed bottom = stone plinth / Erker console m/d. Used for house blocks
# and the Erker (bay window).
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_facade
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
